#####################

# try averaging with nan.mean

# methodstr | callable()
# How to combine the data. If “mean”/”median”, the mean/median are returned. Otherwise, must be a callable which, when passed an array of 
# shape (n_epochs, n_channels, n_time) returns an array of shape (n_channels, n_time). Note that due to file type
#  limitations, the kind for all these will be “average”. 